      "message": "fix(ui): review fixes - row label assertion, \"Part axes\" wording\n\n- structural.rs:262 asserts the new \"Part axes - ...\" row label.\n- plane_pick.rs:73, pick/plane.rs:146 and the doc comments in\n  setup_plane_pick.rs:3 and mcp/align_tools.rs:4 say \"Part axes\".\n- MCP routing through align_from_axes is filed as #1329 (named in the PR body).\n\nRefs #769\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
